WEBVTT

00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:01.055
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.018 --> 00:00:03.838
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> What do you think of my hat?

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:06.385
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:09.446
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Sandy’s got a cute cat.

00:00:11.351 --> 00:00:12.070
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.101 --> 00:00:15.158
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> I really hate being late for work.

00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:17.772
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.467
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> I think we’re going to miss the plane.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.156
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:24.142 --> 00:00:27.302
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> I cut my finger this morning and it really hurts.

00:00:29.258 --> 00:00:30.056
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:31.016 --> 00:00:34.551
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Can I change this £20 note for two tens?

00:00:36.586 --> 00:00:37.280
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:40.154
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> That’s a good plan, let’s do that.

00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:42.720
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:43.688 --> 00:00:46.179
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> Don’t worry, my dog doesn’t bite.

00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:48.824
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:49.825 --> 00:00:52.674
<v><b>Male Speaker:</b></v> This exercise is not as easy as it looks.

00:00:54.584 --> 00:00:55.212
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:00:56.108 --> 00:00:58.640
<v><b>Female Speaker:</b></v> This word is a bit difficult to spell.